# Play test of The Rock Pen (CIPlay the_rock_pen, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe ("offset").
# The prison on the rock's top (17.8 m): the cell block's door at -4.5 6, cell 14 at 4.5 13.5, the mess hall's door at
# -7.5 0.5, the guard tower's ladder at 8.75 -14.1 (its deck 23.8 m); the road up the west face from the dock (-35 25);
# his drain at the north cliff's foot (5 31-36, floor 2.55 m); the outer rock at 4 66.
island The Rock Pen
offset -0.2404 0.5463
expect step 0
expect title Fourteen Months
wait 5
expect animals Turtle 2
expect animals Dolphin 2

# The dock on the west beach: off the jetty to the gate, the warden's notice
walk -46.5 21.5 to -38 21.5 to -35.5 23.5 h=1.6
zone dock
expect step 0
read Warden's notice
expect step 1

# Up the prison road along the west face to the yard
walk -35 25 to -32 24 to -30.4 18 to -27.9 9.2 to -25.5 0.3 to -23 -8.6 to -21 -16 to -17 -16 to -8 -12 to 3 -6 h=17.75
zone yard
expect step 1

# Cell block B: the rats; cell 14 locked
walk 3 -6 to -4.5 2.5 to -4.5 8 to 0 9 h=17.8 below=20
zone cellblock
kill Rat
expect step 2
use cell14
expect message would be up in the tower

# The guard tower: up its ladder to the deck, the guards' box with the key ring
walk 0 9 to -4.5 8 to -4.5 2.5 to 6 -10 to 8.75 -15.3 h=17.75 below=20
climb 8.75 -14.12 h=17.8
expect stand 9.5 -12.5 h=23.8 below=25
at 9.5 -12.5 h=24.6
open Guard tower box
expect story cellkeys 1
expect step 3

# Cell 14 unlocked: the notes under the mattress; the vent wants a screwdriver
use cell14
expect message roll aside
wait 3
walk 3 -6 to -4.5 2.5 to -4.5 8 to 4.5 10 to 4.5 13.2 h=17.8 below=20
read Inmate 1147's notes
expect step 4
use vent
expect message something like one

# The mess hall: the sharpened spoon in the cutlery drawer
walk 4.5 10 to -4.5 8 to -4.5 2.5 to -5.5 0.5 to -9 0.5 to -10.2 -2.4 h=17.8 below=20
open Cutlery drawer
expect story spoon 1
expect step 5

# The vent: down his drain to the cliff's foot, out of its mouth onto the shelf and the beach; the swim to the outer rock
use vent
expect message you crawl
zone tunnel
expect step 6
expect shown escapekit
walk 5 31.6 to 5 34 to 5 36.6 to 5 39.5 h=2.4 below=4.5
at 4 64.5 h=3
zone outerrock
open Escape kit
wait 2
expect done

# The other boxes: the warden's safe (the key ring opens it), the pantry, the laundry, the barrel off the jetty
open Warden's safe
open Mess hall pantry
open Laundry box
open Sunk skiff's barrel
